 recipes of one step and read them side by side, or in an","Evaluate. Score a pipeline against the sample's question set, or upload your own.","Library. Keep saved pipelines and experiments in one list, export them to a file"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nadeem4/rag-playground/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fd3052b22eff7edf610c9edf77f51272750e3634109e78dd837ac911e8f89d4a","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T20:16:33.248Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:11.380Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"RAG Playground runs a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) pipeline on a PDF and shows you every step: what the parser read, what the cleaners removed, where each chunk was cut, what the search found and how the reranker moved it. Each step is a strategy you can swap, so you can change one setting and see what it does.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nadeem4/rag-playground/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"There is no sign in.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nadeem4/rag-playground/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"With demo mode off the copy has no sign in, so anyone with its address can use your keys: make the Space private if you add them.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nadeem4/rag-playground/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fd3052b22eff7edf610c9edf77f51272750e3634109e78dd837ac911e8f89d4a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nadeem4/rag-playground/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:11.380Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T02:14:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nadeem4/rag-playground/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:11.380Z","hash":"fd3052b22eff7edf610c9edf77f51272750e3634109e78dd837ac911e8f89d4a","originalBytes":6583,"storedBytes":6583,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","demo","what","run","upload","key","one","app","build","chat","each","every","llm","pip